  "text": "proprium.omnium-sanctorum-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “All Saints” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "Almighty, eternal God, Who granted us to honor the merits of all Your Saints in a single solemn festival, bestow on us, we beseech You, through their manifold intercession, that abundance of Your mercy for which we yearn. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
